## Import

Import is supported using the following syntax:

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/salesforce_custom_metadata_record/import.sh" }}

Import puts every non-empty field into `values`, including unchecked Checkbox fields
(`false`). The next apply clears every imported field that the configuration leaves
out of `values`, so list all fields whose values you want to keep.
